        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/18/new-revamped-iphone-lineup-coming-in-2027/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/06/iPhone-20th-anniversary-mockup-ios26-03.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iPhone Duo preorders just begun, and iPhone 18 Pro has been on the market for about a month. Of course, iPhone Duo is <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/16/iphone-duo-pre-orders-now-backordered-to-next-year/\">backordered through January</a> right now, so whether or not you’re considering buying these phones – it makes it really easy to think about what’s coming next.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"aapl,iphone\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1074725\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/18/new-revamped-iphone-lineup-coming-in-2027/#more-1074725\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
