        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/iphone-18-pro-burgundy-rc.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As part of its iPhone Duo preorder announcement, UK carrier EE <a href=\"https://newsroom.ee.co.uk/iphone-duo-with-iphone-handoff-only-on-ee/\">has announced</a> pricing details for iPhone Handoff – making it the first carrier in the UK to do so. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"iphone-handoff\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1074693\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/17/iphone-handoff-pricing-details-ee-uk/#more-1074693\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
