        "title": "Apple HomeView unveiled, new Apple TV and HomePod mini first impressions",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/15/happy-hour-612/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2024/02/9to5mac-happy-hour-lead1.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Benjamin and Chance react to Apple’s smart home event, with first impressions on the new Apple HomeView smart display, the insanely priced Apple TV 4K (fourth-generation), and the HomePod mini refresh. It remains to be seen whether these new initiatives in the Apple Home Collection can help move the needle on smart home uptake at large, but it’s a good start.   </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"http://9to5mac.com/join\">And in Happy Hour Plus</a>, the new iOS beta brings a new Apple Music icon. Subscribe at <a href=\"http://9to5mac.com/join\">9to5mac.com/join</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/apple-store/id904237743?pt=13942&amp;ct=Podcast_9to5&amp;mt=8\">Sponsored by Things</a>: The award-winning to-do app, ready for iOS 27 and iPhone Duo. </li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://framer.com/happyhour\">Sponsored by Framer</a>: The only free design tool that brings your ideas to the web. Visit <a href=\"https://framer.com/happyhour\">framer.com/happyhour</a> for 30% off a Framer Pro annual plan.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://shopify.com/happyhour\">Sponsored by Shopify</a>: If you’re ready to launch your business before Black Friday, start your free trial at <a href=\"https://shopify.com/happyhour\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">shopify.com/happyhour</a>.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://quince.com/happyhour\">Sponsored by Quince</a>: Download the Quince app for app-exclusive offers, or visit <a href=\"https://quince.com/happyhour\">quince.com/happyhour</a>. Get free shipping on your order and 365-day returns. Now available in Canada and the UK, too.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-audio\"><audio controls src=\"https://claritaspod.com/measure/dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pfx.vpixl.com/sla7w/pscrb.fm/rss/p/9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/HH-612.mp3\"></audio></figure>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"9to5mac-happy-hour,podcast\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1074464\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/15/happy-hour-612/#more-1074464\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
