        "title": "Meta launches new Muse Spark Open model, optimized to run on Mac Studio",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/15/meta-launches-new-muse-spark-open-model-optimized-to-run-on-mac-studio/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/meta-muse-spark-mac.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://x.com/finkd/status/2110778025629347999?s=20\">Meta today unveiled</a> Muse Spark Open, which it says is the “most capable US open-weight model to date.” For Apple users, Meta says Muse Spark Open is optimized to run on the Mac Studio powered by M5 Ultra.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-silicon\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1074420\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/15/meta-launches-new-muse-spark-open-model-optimized-to-run-on-mac-studio/#more-1074420\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
