        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/airpods.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In addition to the rollout of developer beta 4 for macOS 27.2, iOS 27.2, iPadOS 27.2, and more, Apple also rolled out developer and public firmware betas for several AirPods models. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"airpods\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1074061\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/13/apple-rolls-out-new-airpods-beta-firmware-for-several-models-including-airpods-pro-3/#more-1074061\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
